  "body_html": "<h1>Welfare-Maximizing Knapsack Mechanism</h1>\n<p>Welfare maximization over feasible binary allocations induces a monotone\nallocation rule. Paired with Myerson payments, the resulting single-parameter\nknapsack mechanism is DSIC.</p>",
